?INCLUDE 'ec0A_right_guard'
ec0A_right_guard.dialogstring_04C2E9! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme19]Zzz… Zzz…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_left_guard'
ec0A_left_guard.dialogstring_04C0AF! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme19]Ah[AD] You[AD]![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme19][DLY:0]You escaped from that[N]prison![WAI][N]Take my advice: get out of[N]the castle while you can.[WAI][N]If King Edward finds you[N]here, you're in real[N]trouble.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_stair_maid'
ec0A_stair_maid.dialogstring_04C85A! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme19][DLY:0]You're taking Miss Kara[N]with you, aren't you?[WAI][N]I hope the king doesn't[N]find you[AD][WAI][N]Please take care of the[N]princess.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_kara_guard'
ec0A_kara_guard.dialogstring_04CB3F! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme19]Soldier: Zzz… Zzz…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_kara'
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04CFDB! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought][DLY:0](No. If I'm going to take[N]Kara away, now's the[N]time[AD])[END]`
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04CE4A! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: You came for me[N]after all! Thank you![WAI][N]That guard outside is[N]asleep, right?[WAI][N]That's "Snot Bubble."[N]Now you know why I called[N]him that.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will][DLY:0]Will: Your piglet came for[N]me[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: His name is Hamlet.[N]Cute, isn't he?[WAI][N]He's very clever. He even[N]has a little mysterious[N]power of his own[AD][WAI][N]Alright. Get me out of[N]here![END]`
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04D012! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: Oh, right![N]If we're going on a long[N]journey, we'll need food.[WAI][N]Let's check the basement.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_barrel_roast'
ec0A_barrel_roast.dialogstring_04D114! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: If I remember[N]right, they store food in[N]these barrels.[END]`
ec0A_barrel_roast.dialogstring_04D141! `[DEF][SFX:0][DLY:9]Got bone-in smoked meat![PAU:FF][FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: Good. We're ready.[N]Let's go before the[N]soldiers find us![END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_038D85! `[DEF]Will nibbles the smoked[N]meat.[FIN][DEF]Its taste is unlike[N]anything he has eaten[N]before.[FIN][DEF]What kind of meat could[N]this possibly be[AD]?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'ec0A_kara'
ec0A_kara.dialogstring_04D069! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: Alright. We're[N]really leaving, huh?[WAI][N]First, let's go to your[N]house. You must be worried[N]about your grandparents.[FIN][CLD][DEF]Will and Kara hurry to[N]Will's house.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_kara_return'
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04AF7F! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](No. There has to be a[N]clue somewhere in the[N]house[AD])[END]`
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04A746! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: What the[AD]!?[N]Why does it look like[N]this[AD]?[END]`
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04A766! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: This is awful…![N]Who could have done[N]something like this…[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: What about Grandma[N]and Grandpa!?[END]`
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04A7A8! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Mr. Biiill[AD]![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Grandma Lola![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I'll check upstairs![END]`
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04A7E1! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Eeeeeeek!![N]Will! Come here! Quick![N]It's a disaster, a[N]disaster![END]`
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04A81F! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: What happened!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Look at this mark![WAI][N]A jackal[AD][N]It means Jackal was here![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Jackal[AD]?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: The assassin my[N]parents hired.[WAI][N]He's relentless. Once he[N]chooses a target, he never[N]stops hunting them.[WAI][N]Human life means nothing[N]to him.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Then Grandpa and[N]Grandma[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_lily'
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04AC0C! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You don't have to[N]worry, you two.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: You're the girl from[N]the castle basement[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_kara_return'
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04A945! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Who are youuu!?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I'm Will's friend.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Lilly, do you know[N]something?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: It's okay. Grandpa[N]Bill and Grandma Lola are[N]safe too.[FIN]They're hiding in my[N]village.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Your village?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_lily'
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04AC45! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: The village of the[N]Itory clan.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I haven't even[N]heard of a village like[N]that![END]`
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04AC77! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Of course not![WAI][N]A barrier hides our[N]village from ordinary[N]people.[WAI][N]Come on, Will![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Right![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I'm coming too![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Your Highness, it[N]could be dangerous[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I'm coming. I want[N]to be truly free![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Figures, Your[N]Highness.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_kara_return'
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04A9D7! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: To go places and do[N]things without guidance[N]or approval.[WAI][N]I'd be nervous if I[N]weren't so excited![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_lily'
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04AD69! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Do you want to[N]say goodbye to everyone[N]before we go?[WAI][N]It may be a while before[N]we come back.[END]`
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04ADCA! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Ready already?[WAI][N]Or do you want to look[N]around town a little[N]longer?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc02_seth'
sc02_seth.dialogstring_04B5ED! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme5]Ugh, it's always me…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc02_lance'
sc02_lance.dialogstring_04B40D! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: What's the matter,[N]Will? Ya look pretty[N]down.[WAI][N]Something going on ya[N]can't tell us about?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc02_erik'
sc02_erik.dialogstring_04BBDA! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: What's wrong? You're[N]different than usual.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_lily'
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04ADFE! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Have you decided[N]to head out?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04AE24! `[CLR]Lilly: I see. Come back[N]when you're ready to set[N]out.[END]`
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04AE61! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I feel like all[N]sorts of wonderful things[N]are ahead of us.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: And plenty of[N]trouble too, I'm sure[AD][N]*Sigh*[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_kara_return'
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04A9F8! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: That's why I want to[N]make sure we're prepared.[N]We need a plan![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_lily'
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04AEC1! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Have you ever even[N]been outside the castle?[N]The 'plan' is listen to[N]Will and me.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_kara_return'
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04AA0D! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: You're insufferable.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_lily'
sc06_lily.dialogstring_04AEF7! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: What did you say,[N]you sheltered little[AD]![WAI][N]Will's my friend. You[N]understand that, right?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sc06_kara_return'
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04AA20! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Ah, you're my[N]friend too, right?![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Will][PAL:0] Yeah, of course[N] We hardly know each other`
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04AA7D! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I'm glad, Will. Come[N]on, let's hold hands as we[N]go.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3]Like this, the three[N]headed to Lilly's[N]village.[END]`
sc06_kara_return.dialogstring_04AAAD! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly:[N]I'm going with you.[N]Let's go.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2]The three set out for[N]Lilly's village.[END]`
